## Getting Started

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/ChatiFy.git
cd ChatiFy

# Backend
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev

# Frontend
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Create a `.env` file in `backend/`:

```
PORT=5000
MONGO_DB_URI=your_mongodb_connection
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_key
```

